            "snippet": "Small to Average Asphalt Shingle Roof: 1 to 2 days for a straightforward, single-story home."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Large, Steep, or Complex Roof:\n2 to 4 days if the roof has multiple angles, dormers, or high pitches."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Metal or Tile Roof: 3 to 5+ days because metal panels and tiles require more detailed, precise installation."
          }
        ],
